      "id": "route-unreferenced",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "GET /index.php/apps/sfxontrain/run/{runId}  sfxontrain.player.show  lib/Controller/PlayerController.php:39"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "Nothing in the app calls 1 route outside OCS. Looked for: a route name or a path in the PHP source and the templates, in 34 files of the frontend source and in the navigation of info.xml. The frontend puts the path of the app and the rest of a URL together at run time, so every text there that reads like a path below the app counted as a call. A route stays behind when the frontend stops calling it. A route that only a client outside the app calls shows here as well, unless its method allows requests from other origins (CORS).",
        "  GET /index.php/apps/sfxontrain/run/{runId}  sfxontrain.player.show  lib/Controller/PlayerController.php:39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "migration-name-length",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/Version010100Date20261113184700.php:60 the primary key of sfxon_train_cert_download, named after the table: 25 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 31 to 32",
        "lib/Migration/Version010100Date20261113185100.php:61 the primary key of sfxon_train_user_notice, named after the table: 23 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 31 to 32"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 names in the migrations are longer than the server allows, so it stops the install or the update of the app with an exception. The table names are counted with the default prefix oc_.",
        "  Up to Nextcloud 32 the server checks this only where info.xml lists no database, or lists oci among them.",
        "  lib/Migration/Version010100Date20261113184700.php:60 the primary key of sfxon_train_cert_download, named after the table: 25 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 31 to 32",
        "  lib/Migration/Version010100Date20261113185100.php:61 the primary key of sfxon_train_user_notice, named after the table: 23 characters and the prefix oc_, in Nextcloud 31 to 32"
      ]
    },
